{"c":{"36309":["Narrator",null,"b36309-6KM0riV4lqfN.jpg","This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven't been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work.",2200],"124618":["Jahy","Female","b124618-wsHo2rR91A9V.png","Jahy was originally the Dark Realm's second-in-command. After the destruction of the Mana Crystals, however, she becomes a small and adorable girl! She works as a part-time waitress.",1276],"133102":["Kyouko Jinguu","Female","b133102-mU3qfdTnRIff.jpg","The one who destroyed Jahy's home world.",113],"133103":["Ryou","Female","b133103-RvqNYl4F2akN.jpg","The landlady of the apartment complex Jahy resides in. Her sister is the owner of the restaurant Jahy works at. She is ready to resort to violence in order to get her rent and, unlike her sister, is ready to throw Jahy on the streets at any moment.",133],"133104":["Druj ","Female","b133104-cyO5IF7xaa2U.png","Former denizen of the Dark Realm. As Jahy's loyal servant, she is willing to anything and everything for her master.",215],"133105":["Chisa","Female","b133105-KIQgMplUFhoC.jpg","The owner of the restaurant Jahy works at. Her sister is the landlady of the apartment Jahy lives in. She is a nice person who cares for Jahy. She tends to call Jahy \"Hy-chan,\" even though Jahy tells her otherwise.",193],"133106":["Kokoro","Female","n133106-o4MDUjB3x7Xa.jpg","A young girl who lives in the same town as Jahy. Upon meeting Jahy, she agrees to help her find Mana Crystals in order to restore the Dark Realm. She and Jahy quickly become best friends. Jahy credits her as one of the only people who understands her.",53],"133107":["Saurva","Female","b133107-fEBCGVHlOcGg.png","Former elite of the Dark Realm. She was transported to the human world, where she continues to try and beat Jahy.",148],"157951":["Maou","Female","b157951-8QZvFaVcHMHp.jpg","The ruler of the Dark Realm, and Jahy's sole superior who was destroyed as a result of the destruction of the Mana Cryst